# 🔴 NOTHING THAT `go build` OR `go test` NEEDS MAY BE IGNORED. The project
# muster was extracted from gitignored an asset its own source `go:embed`ed, so
# `go build` failed on a fresh clone — the first promise its README made. If a
# build input belongs in this file, the build needs a step that produces it.

# Local binaries, if anyone builds one by hand.
/muster
/muster-migrate

# nix
result
result-*

# Front-end tooling, fetched on demand by `make css` (npx). NOT the stylesheet
# it produces — see the header above: web/static/app.css is COMMITTED, because a
# later `go:embed` makes it a build input and `make css-check` is what keeps the
# committed copy honest.
node_modules/

# Python byte cache from the gates in tests/.
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Editor / OS droppings.
*.swp
.DS_Store
